A closed fence in a description body ends it

```
:: term
:  definition
   ::: note
   body
   :::
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>definition</p>
    <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
      <p>body</p>
    </aside>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

````
:: term
:  definition
   ```
   c
   ```
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>definition</p>
    <pre><code>c
</code></pre>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
````

